out/

# Stray logo source artifact dropped at the repo root; the shipped favicons
# live in web/public/ (favicon.ico, favicon-16/32.png, apple-touch-icon.png)
# and the brand marks in web/public/brand/.
Fevicon HOR.png

# Master-data analysis output. Derived from data/reference/, so it carries the
# same real store product data — UPCs, descriptions and costs — and is excluded
# for the same reason. Regenerate with scripts/analyze_product_master.py.
analysis/
